DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows still dominate = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Wed 18 Nov): 21 highs vs 357 lows (WSJ), a little better than Tuesday's 18 vs 420 (the worst in our chart, which starts 6 Oct) but still lopsided as the S&P fell a fifth straight day. Lows have beaten highs on every session in our chart this month except 4 Nov; more highs than lows again would be the first sign of healing."};

